* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* XSISZHA 2000-07-31 (CE7461) EXTEND REPORT AND BUNDLE NAMES
* SU1     2013-01-31 unused      Deactivate unused data areas
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #BUNDLE(A25)          /* (A8) XSISZHA (CE7461)
1 #EXIST(L)
**LOCAL USING VMBUND-L /*SU1 out
LOCAL
1 BUNDLES VIEW OF NRM-BUNDLES /*SU1 in
END-DEFINE
*
FIND-BUND. FIND NUMBER BUNDLES WITH B-BUNDLE = #BUNDLE
IF *NUMBER(FIND-BUND.) > 0
   MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
ELSE
  MOVE FALSE TO #EXIST
END-IF
.
